{"id":"576d33e6f68f255a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-lem-zorn.md","title":"Zorn's Lemma","display":"lem-zorn — Zorn's Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-zorn","aliases":["58-lem-zorn"],"display":"lem-zorn — Zorn's Lemma","depends_on":["[[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-zorn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-zorn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-zorn — Zorn's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ea17c91dcff1011\" href=\"?note=6ea17c91dcff1011\" title=\"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md\">58-df-axiom-of-choice.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,C,\\leq_P\\in V,\\quad \\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(P,C,\\leq_P\\in V,\\quad \\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ea17c91dcff1011\" href=\"?note=6ea17c91dcff1011\" title=\"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md\">58-df-axiom-of-choice.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}zorn} \\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\to\n\\forall P\\in V\\;\\forall\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\n\\to\\exists m\\in P\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle m,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to p=m)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}zorn} \\vdash \\mathrm{AC}_S\\to\n\\forall P\\in V\\;\\forall\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in\\leq_P))\n\\to\\exists m\\in P\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle m,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to p=m)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Zorn's lemma is equivalent to the axiom of choice.</li>\n<li>Upper bounds and maximality are expressed through the quantified order relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ea17c91dcff1011","anchor":"re